Description: provider-neutral GitHub development orchestrator
 Vibecoder coordinates authorized GitHub Issues, immutable human-approved
 plans, isolated AI workers, Git workspaces and human-merged pull requests.
 It starts safely in standby until GitHub and a worker are configured.
